  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Let \\(x\\) be the number of students who perform well in English only.\n\n\\[\n\\text{Percentage}=\\frac{x}{22}\\times 100\\%\n\\]\n\nThe number of English-only students is not provided, so a numerical percentage cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\frac{x}{22}\\times 100\\%}\n\\]",
    "Let \\(x\\) be the number of students who perform well in English only.\n\nThere are 20 students total, so:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Percentage}=\\frac{x}{20}\\times 100\\%=5x\\%\n\\]\n\nThe number of students who perform well in English only is still needed to calculate a specific percentage.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{5x\\%}\n\\]",
    "There are 7 students who perform well in English only out of 20 students total.\n\n\\[\n\\frac{7}{20}\\times 100\\% = 35\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{35\\%}\n\\]",
    "There are 8 students who perform well in English only out of 20 students.\n\n\\[\n\\frac{8}{20}\\times 100\\% = 40\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{40\\%}\n\\]",
